A marker region mixes an inline element, prose and an interpolation. Its
children normalize like a fragment: layout-only indentation disappears,
while the newline between <span>x</span> and the following prose supplies
one word separator. Pin both region traversal and automatic prose spacing.
-- input.gsx --
package views

component Page(id string) {
	<?start name="feed">
		<span>x</span>
		loading { id }
	<?end>
}
-- invoke --
Page("row-1")
-- render.golden --
<?start name="feed"><span>x</span> loading row-1<?end>
